 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He was twenty-three when he took the throne",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His mother Hamutal from Libnah was known",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Three short months in Jerusalem he stayed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Evil in the Lord's sight was the way",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Pharaoh Neco came to take his place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Riblah became his prison and his race",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A hundred talents of silver and gold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The heavy weight of the tribute told",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He could not reign in Jerusalem's gate",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Imprisoned in the land of Hamath state",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His brother Eliakim rose to the crown",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Jehoiakim was the name he received now",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Pharaoh Neco came to take his place",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Riblah became his prison and his race",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A hundred talents of silver and gold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The heavy weight of the tribute told",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To Egypt he was taken by force",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And there in the distance he found his course",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Jehoahaz died far from his home",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
